{"type": "message", "id": "p003", "parentId": "p002", "timestamp": "2026-10-23T11:02:00.000Z", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Concise Read:\nAgent runs, drawn by the Mantine runtime in a sandboxed page.\n\n```mantine-widget\nconst [range, setRange] = useState(\"Week\");\nconst [note, setNote] = useState(\"\");\nconst data = range === \"Week\"\n  ? [{ day: \"Mon\", runs: 3 }, { day: \"Tue\", runs: 5 }, { day: \"Wed\", runs: 2 }, { day: \"Thu\", runs: 6 }, { day: \"Fri\", runs: 4 }]\n  : [{ day: \"W1\", runs: 14 }, { day: \"W2\", runs: 19 }, { day: \"W3\", runs: 11 }, { day: \"W4\", runs: 22 }];\nreturn (\n  <Card withBorder padding=\"md\">\n    <Stack gap=\"sm\">\n      <Group justify=\"space-between\">\n        <Title order={4}>Agent runs</Title>\n        <Badge variant=\"light\">{range}</Badge>\n      </Group>\n      <SegmentedControl fullWidth value={range} onChange={setRange} data={[\"Week\", \"Month\"]} />\n      <BarChart h={160} data={data} dataKey=\"day\" series={[{ name: \"runs\", color: \"blue.6\" }]} tickLine=\"none\" />\n      <TextInput label=\"Note\" placeholder=\"Anything to add?\" value={note} onChange={(e) => setNote(e.currentTarget.value)} />\n      <Button fullWidth onClick={() => relay.reply(`Runs by ${range.toLowerCase()}${note ? `: ${note}` : \"\"}`)}>Send summary</Button>\n    </Stack>\n  </Card>\n);\n```\n\nAnd the same week as a plain HTML widget:\n\n```html-widget\n<div class=\"card\">\n  <div class=\"label\">Deploys this week</div>\n  <div class=\"value\">12</div>\n  <div class=\"note\">2 rolled back</div>\n  <button onclick=\"relay.reply('Show the rollbacks')\">Show the rollbacks</button>\n</div>\n<style>\n  .card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 14px 16px; }\n  .label { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }\n  .value { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 600; margin: 2px 0; }\n  .note { color: var(--warn); font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n  button { background: var(--accent); color: white; border: 0; border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 6px 12px; cursor: pointer; }\n</style>\n```\n"}], "api": "anthropic-messages", "provider": "anthropic", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "usage": {"input": 12000, "output": 4000, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "totalTokens": 16000}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1792753320000}}
